  checked 98400 (d,e,k) triples; mismatches: 0

STEP 2  the witness set at a flank IS the CRT intersection
  checked 2800 (set,flank) pairs; mismatches: 0

STEP 3  when the moduli c_d are PAIRWISE COPRIME, CRT makes the six
        constraints independent: a witness exists iff every A_d is nonempty.
  pairwise-coprime moduli :    59 flanks, rule 'all A_d nonempty <=> witness' correct 59/59
  NOT pairwise coprime    :  2741 flanks, same rule correct 2634/2741  (96.1%)
